---
// Ubicación - lime card on left + map image on right
---
<section class="relative w-full min-w-[1280px] min-h-screen overflow-hidden bg-vecta-night flex items-center justify-center">
  <!-- Map image bleeds full-width across the viewport -->
  <img
    src="/sections/ubicacion/map-bg.png"
    alt="Mapa de ubicación Carrera 15 con calle 98"
    class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
  />

  <!-- Lime panel bleeds from the viewport's left edge to the original
       Figma right edge (canvas-x=639, i.e. 1px before viewport center). -->
  <div class="absolute left-0 inset-y-0 bg-vecta-lime"
       style="width: calc(50vw - 1px); min-width: 639px;"></div>

  <!-- Lime-panel text wrapper: mirrors the lime panel width so text stays
       centered in it regardless of viewport width. -->
  <div class="absolute left-0 inset-y-0" style="width: calc(50vw - 1px); min-width: 639px;">
    <!-- Decorative bracket around the heading + subtitle (Figma 2075:350,
         2075:351, 2075:352, 2075:353): two full-panel horizontal rules above
         and below the title block, plus a vertical rule with two dots at the
         intersections. The vertical/dot column sits at Figma x=149 in the
         639-wide lime panel (i.e. 170.5 px left of the panel centerline). -->
    <div class="absolute left-0 right-0 h-px bg-vecta-dark" style="top: 153px;"></div>
    <div class="absolute left-0 right-0 h-px bg-vecta-dark" style="top: 380px;"></div>
    <div class="absolute w-px bg-vecta-dark"
         style="top: 106px; height: 728px; left: calc(50% - 171px);"></div>
    <div class="absolute w-[12px] h-[12px] rounded-full bg-vecta-dark"
         style="top: 147px; left: calc(50% - 177px);"></div>
    <div class="absolute w-[12px] h-[12px] rounded-full bg-vecta-dark"
         style="top: 374px; left: calc(50% - 177px);"></div>

    <!-- All text is left-aligned at Figma x=184 (35 px right of the vertical
         bracket line at x=149). 184 - 319.5 = -135.5 px from the 639-wide
         panel centerline, so we anchor everything via calc(50% - 135.5px). -->
    <h2 class="absolute top-[186px] w-[395px] text-vecta-dark font-semibold text-[60px] leading-[0.959]"
        style="font-family: 'Albert Sans', sans-serif; left: calc(50% - 135.5px);">
      Ubicación que funciona
    </h2>

    <p class="absolute top-[317px] text-vecta-dark text-[32px] leading-[0.959]"
       style="font-family: 'Albert Sans', sans-serif; left: calc(50% - 135.5px);">
      Carrera 15 con calle 98.
    </p>

    <div class="absolute top-[450px] w-[374px] text-vecta-dark text-[32px] leading-[0.959] space-y-[1.2em]"
         style="font-family: 'Albert Sans', sans-serif; left: calc(50% - 135.5px);">
      <p>Una zona con movimiento constante, conectividad y actividad real.</p>
      <p>
        No es una promesa de valorización futura.<br/>
        Es una ubicación que ya funciona.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Decorative horizontal line -->
    <div class="absolute top-[590px] w-[292px] h-px bg-vecta-dark"
         style="left: calc(50% - 135.5px);"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Inner 1280px canvas for elements anchored to the design canvas -->
  <div class="relative w-[1280px] h-[832px] mx-auto">
    <!-- Map pin -->
    <div class="absolute left-[860px] top-[330px] w-[40px] h-[40px] rounded-full bg-vecta-lime border-4 border-vecta-dark flex items-center justify-center">
      <div class="w-[10px] h-[10px] rounded-full bg-vecta-dark"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
